state":"closed","created_at":"2025-11-27T20:29:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T18:39:31Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-06-19T16:54:35Z"},"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-06-17T12:06:47Z","updated_at":"2026-06-18T08:07:01Z","closed_at":"2026-06-17T17:37:58Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120363","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120363","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120363.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120363.patch","merged_at":"2026-06-17T17:37:58Z"},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Partially closes #120299\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nThe first problem in the linked issue specifically occurs with an ubershader. We don't know the underlying reason yet. So, similar to #119639, we can \"skip\" the ubershader and force a fallback to the specialized shader.\r\n\r\nUnlike #119639, the driver returns an error code from `vkCreateGraphicsPipelines` instead of crashing outright, so we don't have to go as far as disabling all ubershaders. Instead, we can ignore the failed ubershader and retry the specialized shader, waiting for it to compile to avoid pop-in. This will still introduce some pipeline compilation stutter, but significantly less than #119639, since any ubershaders that compile successfully will continue to be used.\r\n\r\nThis approach is global so it'll work on all devices, but it will still produce harmless error logs. To address that, I added a specific workaround to mute error messages on Adreno 660, since we expect this behavior on it.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120363/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120363/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}